# UI & Tailwind (Monochrome Logic)

Source of truth: `.stitch/DESIGN.md` + tokens in `app/assets/css/main.css`.

## Design pillars

- Strict **monochrome**; hierarchy via type, borders, whitespace — not shadows/gradients.
- **Sharp corners only** (`rounded-none` / radius tokens are `0`). Never soften with `rounded-lg`/`rounded-full`.
- Hover elevation: invert colors or use existing `card-hover` (offset + hard shadow), not soft blur shadows.
- Fonts: **Geist** (UI/headings), **JetBrains Mono** (labels/buttons/code).

## Tokens & utilities (use these)

Colors: `bg-background`, `text-primary`, `text-secondary`, `border-primary`, `bg-surface-container-lowest`, `bg-code-bg`, …

Type: `text-headline-xl|lg|md`, `text-body-lg|md`, `text-label`, `text-code`

Layout: `container-site`, `section-gap`, `gap-gutter`, `pb-section` / `pb-section-mobile`

```vue
<!-- ✅ -->
<h1 class="text-headline-xl text-primary uppercase">…</h1>
<p class="text-body-lg text-secondary">…</p>

<!-- ❌ -->
<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">…</h1>
```

## @nuxt/ui

- Wrap app in `<UApp>` (already in `app.vue`).
- Prefer **project components** (`UiAppButton`, `UiAppTag`, `UiProjectCard`, …) over stock `UButton`/`UCard` for branded UI.
- `useToast()` is fine for errors (see `ContactForm`).

## Theme

- `colorMode`: system preference, `classSuffix: ''` (`.dark` on root).
- New colors go through CSS vars (`--p-*`) + `@theme` mapping — don't hardcode hex in Vue unless matching an existing token.
